ial: flooding stdout is line-streamed; last turn.completed usage wins","CHK-001 adversarial: inherited/polluted usage never fabricates counts (own-property projection)"]},{"id":"story-binding","checks":["case20","case21","case22","case23","case24","case25","case26"],"descriptions":["CHK-002 binding: reviewRunId->threadId, lane->subagentId, phase resolves from the configured store","CHK-002 edge: omitted reviewRunId/lane -> threadId/subagentId null (no empty-string pollution)","CHK-002 edge: unknown storyId (per configured store) fails pre-spawn (runner never invoked)","CHK-002 adversarial: cross-story reviewRunId refused pre-spawn (runner never invoked)","F-005: explicit --phase is honored AS-IS with NO story-store read (fake resolver never consulted)","F-005: unknown story is NOT refused when --phase overrides (the exact configured-storyDir bug)","F-005: storyId with a store phase of null falls back to adhoc (no fabricated phase)"]},{"id":"streaming","checks":["case27","case28","case29","case30","case31","case32","case33","case34","case35"],"descriptions":["F-006: default runner streams stdout live \u2014 first line reaches the sink BEFORE process exit","F-243: stdoutDigest hashes raw provider bytes before UTF-8 decoding","F-006: host output is delivered through the passthrough EXACTLY once (no double-print) with a buffered runner","F-006: an oversized single usage line is bounded (dropped + truncation flag) -> no parse target, never OOM/fabrication","F-013 codex: valid turn.completed then an over-cap final usage line -> unavailable (usage_line_retention_truncated), never the stale earlier numbers","F-013 claude: valid result envelope then an over-cap line -> unavailable (usage_line_retention_truncated), not the stale envelope","F-026 scanner unit: drop-then-candidate clears the flag; candidate-then-drop sets it (F-013); drop-only stays set (F-006); a retained-nothing line never clears it","F-026 codex (the RED): an over-cap NON-usage line followed by a valid turn.